        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0009015</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:431</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Functions in conduction and support. In shoot axes (PO:0025029), vascular tissue is often found as part of a shoot axis stele (PO:0025198) or as scattered vascular bundles (PO:0005020). May include other types of tissues or cells, such as parenchyma (PO:0005421) or fiber cells (PO:0025407).</rdfs:comment>
